  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<br>Say hello to TraSea's Mark in the Sand — formerly the \"Sea-Esta\" Beach House! We just had to rename this cutie after its proud parents: Mark + Tracy = \"TraSea's Mark In The Sand\"! 391 Blue Mountain Rd, is tucked just steps from the beach access in Old Blue Mountain Beach on Scenic 30A—one of the coveted, most magical spots along 30-A. <br><br>This two-story treasure is all about family fun and sandy toes...Featuring over 2,200 sq ft, An upstairs primary bedroom with a king size bed, walk-in closet and separate shower and soaking tub in the bathroom. French doors lead out to the balcony to enjoy your morning coffee or lay in bed and catch up on your favorite TV shows. <br><br>The open upstairs kitchen + living area is made for epic family nights around the dining room table, movie snuggles on the couch with a 65\" Smart TV, or chilling with toes up on the balcony after a full beach day! Alongside the couch is a cozy sitting area with four swivel chairs, perfect for curling up with a good beach book and a morning cup of coffee.<br><br>Downstairs Details — three bedrooms + two full baths. <br>---The poolside bedroom features a king bed and a 42\" smart TV, LED lighting, and French doors leading out to the pool. (Sleeps 2)<br><br>---An additional bedroom also features a king bed with 42\" Smart TV, large closet and is located right next to the kitchenette. (Sleeps 2)<br><br>---Lastly, the fun awaits for the kiddos in the bunk room featuring a custom made bunk area. Two Twin-over-full bunks with lighting and built-in charging stations so everyone stays powered up for tomorrow's adventures! The bunk room also feature a private bathroom with full shower. Please note: Maximum occupancy is 6 guests in this room, but this is intended for children. For teenagers, this room is more suitable to sleep 4.<br><br> ---A handy kitchenette downstairs: full fridge, Keurig coffee station, and snack-stashing cabinets for the late night snacks. The laundry area is also downstairs...right next to the \"Selfie Wall\"!!! (because everyone needs an outfit check before leaving the beach house for dinner out on 30-A!<br><br>The best of the best you ask about Trasea's Mark in the Sand? How about your very own private pool to splash in, and you're literally steps to the sugar-white sand and emerald green waters this area is known for. Literally it's just a few houses down to the beach access!!!!<br><br>Come make sweet memories at TraSea's Mark in the Sand — we can't wait to welcome your crew! Book now... because your beachy happily-ever-after starts here at TraSea's Mark in the Sand!<br><br>Other Notes of Interest:<br>1. You must be 25 to rent. No Exceptions!<br>2. The Maximum Occupancy is 12, however please read the bedding description to make sure the bedding configuration suits your party.<br>3. NO PETS!!! <br>4. Our rates are set to reflect the quality and experience we provide, so we’re unable to offer discounts. We do our best to keep pricing fair and competitive year-round.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
